{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0042_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "c06f9d739576acc7c72f7dfafbdde5d97d864d08b1837a36bb66ea168fefbe48", "ja": "そうなんです！\nさっすが{$P$}、察しがいいですね！", "zh": "没错！\n不愧是{$P$}，脑袋转得真快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0042_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "3b3a60b6709e782c9cd6f6712e9000c1c7902973ca1afb43c696207a6c2cbbed", "ja": "これまでいろんなカワイイを会得してきたボクですが、\n次は子猫！　これで、勝てます！", "zh": "在下至今以来学会了各式各样不同的可爱，\n下一个要学的是小猫！这样就有胜算了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0042_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "b564ed41b2b6a77dc033eda718fe0d1f3446a6898aebc3f1d6ddcf16e8428beb", "ja": "というわけで、ボクに構わず仕事を続けてください！\nいっくぞ～！　にゃっふ～ん……ふな～う……♪", "zh": "所以呢，你不用管在下，请继续工作吧！\n要上啰～！喵呼～嗯……呼哪～呜……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
